guide forever/horde/orc-troll/01-durotar
title Durotar
faction Horde
race Orc,Troll
levels 1-12
zone Durotar
next forever/horde/orc-troll/02-the-barrens

# Route: the simulator's consensus Orc route (data/sim/export/consensus-horde-orc,
# visit 1, Durotar 1-11.9). Trolls start in the same valley and share it.
#
# Flow: Valley of Trials -> Sen'jin Village (report) -> Razor Hill (bind) ->
# Razormane Grounds -> Tiragarde Keep -> Razor Hill -> Rezlak, Drygulch Ravine
# and Thunder Ridge -> hearth -> the wreckage and the coast -> Sen'jin Village ->
# Echo Isles and the south-east shore -> Kolkar Crag -> Razor Hill -> Fizzle
# Darkstorm -> Razor Hill -> Heglan's shore, the naga coast, Margoz and Skull
# Rock -> Razor Hill -> west over the Southfury River to Far Watch Post and the
# Crossroads (flight path, bind). The Barrens guide starts at the Crossroads.
#
# Local order fixed by hand (same quest set as the export unless listed below):
# - Legging It (96821) is taken at Sen'jin on the first visit: its spiders sit
#   on the road north to Razor Hill, where Gar'Thok takes it.
# - Rezlak's second pair (A Simmering Storm 97281, Stormy Potential 97282) and
#   Lost But Not Forgotten (816) are done on the first Thunder Ridge visit at
#   about 8.5 instead of a second trip there at 11: the orb drops from the
#   Storm Witches you already kill, and the lizards and Misha are next door.
# - A Missing Hand / Threat from Below (99048, 99049, 99051) and Conscript of
#   the Horde (840) are taken at Razor Hill at 10.5, when Orgnil and Takrin
#   first offer them; the naga coast is done on the way to Margoz.
# - Conscript of the Horde (840) is turned in at Far Watch Post on the way to
#   the Crossroads (the export turns it in on a later pass); Crossroads
#   Conscription (842) goes to Sergra in the Barrens guide.
# - Pa'zula's residue (96873) is collected on the Echo Isles, where the trolls
#   drop the Hexed Pendants, and handed in on the way back.
#
# Class quests: Warlocks do Ruzan's Vile Familiars (1485, 1499) instead of
# Zureetha's. At 10 in Razor Hill: Warriors take Veteran Uzzek (1505) and do
# Path of Defense (1498) at Far Watch Post on the way out (Thun'grim 1502 and
# Forged Steel 1503 follow in the Barrens guide); Shamans take Call of Fire
# (2983), continued in the Barrens guide; Hunters tame their three beasts for
# Thotar (6062, 6083, 6082) around Razor Hill. Training the Beast (6081),
# Gan'rul's Summons (1506, Warlock) and The Shattered Hand (1963, Rogue) need
# Orgrimmar, which this route does not visit before 19: take them there.
#
# Left out: quests the route accepts and never turns in: The Admiral's Orders
# (831, to Nazgrel), Need for a Cure (812), Neeru Fireblade (829).
# Burning Shadows (832) is carried to Neeru Fireblade in Orgrimmar (about 19).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Valley of Trials

step Kaltunk
  accept 4641                         -- Kaltunk, where you start

step Gornek
  tip Gornek waits inside the Den, the building just west of Kaltunk.
  turnin 4641
  accept 788
  accept 97279

