# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The coast and Sen'jin

step The wreckage
  tip The gnomish toolboxes lie in the wreckage along the shore east and south-east of Razor Hill. Follow the shore south to Sen'jin.
  collect 4863 quest 825.1

