step Echo Isles
  tip Head south through the isles. The Loa idols lie all over the southern isles; Voodoo and Hexed Trolls hold them and drop the Hexed Pendants. Zalazane and Minshina's cage are on the southernmost isle.
  collect 277135 quest 97225.1
  kill 3206 quest 826.1
  kill 3207 quest 826.2
